-green-park/22.avif\" alt=\"Interior project by 9th Corner in Green Park, Delhi\" title=\"Green Park Project\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-alok-verma-south-x/mr-alok-verma-south-x/74.avif\" alt=\"Home interior by 9th Corner in South Extension, Delhi\" title=\"South Extension Home\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQS:auto -->\n        <section class=\"faq-section\">\n            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-list\">\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">What does modern interior design mean for a Hauz Khas home?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">It means open, uncluttered rooms with clean lines, neutral colours and practical furniture. In compact South Delhi floors, this approach makes rooms feel larger and brighter.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Can modern design feel warm and not cold?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. Wood, textured fabrics, warm lighting and plants soften a modern space, so it feels welcoming as well as stylish.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Is modern design suitable for cafés and studios?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. Many cafés, studios and boutiques in Hauz Khas use a modern style because it lets the product, art or food take centre stage.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">How is modern interior design different from minimalism?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Minimalism keeps only the essentials. A modern style is also clean and simple, but it allows more materials, colour and personal pieces.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>A Modern Home That Still Feels Like Yours</h2>\n            <p>Good modern interior design should not look like a showroom. It should make mornings easier, give everything a place and still feel personal.</p><p>Planning a new home, a renovation or a commercial space in Hauz Khas? <a href=\"/hauzkhas/contact\">Talk to 9th Corner</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}